    "body": "It looks like the world could really use a per-site blocker/spoofer for the AudioContext API. (See https://audiofingerprint.openwpm.com/) Maybe blocking/spoofing this API could be added to CanvasBlocker? Or, if that's too much a departure, maybe a separate extension using the same  per-site blocker/spoofer model as CanvasBlocker?\n",
